From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:32:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] v2: add libmdbx disk state, flat-file block/undo stores, and
 runtime stores

Adds libmdbx-backed DiskStateStore, TransactionHistory, candidate_store,
flat-file blk*.dat / rev*.dat block and undo storage, and runtime
coordination stores with unit tests.
